              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 32:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, mfalume wauza ushauri ayae, achitengeza ana ngʼombe airi a zahabu. Alafu waambira atu, “Ni kazi mbifu yo muhendayo ya kukpwera kuphiya Jerusalemu kpwenda-kpwenda kpwendavoya. Lolani mwino Aiziraeli, hino ndiyo milungu yenu iriyokutuluzani kula tsi ya Misiri!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waika mmwenga mudzi wa Betheli na wa phiri mudzi wa Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dzambo hiri rakala dambi, mana atu alungana kpwendaabudu mbere za hiye wa Betheli na hata wa hiko Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeroboamu piya wadzenga mizuka phatu pha dzulu, achitsambula alavyadzi-sadaka ambao kala sio a chivyazi cha Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.33+LEV.23.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 23:33–34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeroboamu piya waihenda siku ya kumi na tsano ya mwezi wa nane",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:32",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Siku hino ya kalenda ya mwezi wa kungʼala inagbwa sawa na mwisho wa mwezi wa kumi au mwandzo wa mwezi wa kumi na mwenga wa kalenda ya Chizungu, mwezi mmwenga bada ya sharee ya vibanda. Lola",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 23:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ikale sikukuu sawa na sikukuu ya chidini yokala inahendeka hiko Juda. Walavya sadaka phatu pha kulavira sadaka ariphotengeza, hiko Betheli mbere za hara ana ngʼombe ariotengeza. Waika alavyadzi-sadaka arioatsambula ahumike chila phatu pha dzulu pha kulavira sadaka ariphotengeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku iyo ya kumi na tsano ya mwezi wa nane,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:33",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mwezi dza 1 Afalume 12:32.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ambayo wayiika ye mwenye, waphiya Betheli kpwendalavya sadaka. Phahi wabunisha sikukuu iyo ariyoyiika kpwa ajili ya Aiziraeli ili Aiziraeli ailunge siku zosi na ye mwenye achipanda kuelekeya phatu pha kulavira sadaka, kufukiza uvumba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
